      grouped query attention (GQA https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.13245) is
      performed if `N` is a multiple of `K`, and multi-query attention (MQA
      https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.02150) is performed if `K == 1` (a special case
      of GQA).
